# The temporal generalization experiment, as one graph.
#
#     # once: upload the two raw months to /staging FROM the machine that has them.
#     # They are not Zenodo items and *.zip is gitignored, so no pull brings them.
#     #   host        transfer.chtc.wisc.edu
#     #   destination /staging/<first letter of netid>/<netid>/oco2/
#     #   files       OCO2SimUQExpt_202003.zip, OCO2SimUQExpt_202007.zip (flat, exact names)
#     # See docs/hpc.md, "the temporal hold-out".
#
#     condor_submit_dag months.dag
#     ./fetch_results.sh --months
#
# Two CPU jobs turn the raw months into spectra, covariates and split tables; six GPU jobs
# score February's models on them. Nothing is trained. Roughly 40 minutes of CPU per month
# and half an hour of GPU per task, and the two months are independent, so the whole graph
# is about two hours wall clock with a free queue.
#
# `det_study`/`flow_study` are declared here rather than in eval_month.sub because a
# mismatched pair does not fail -- it scores a different model and produces a plausible
# number. The pairs are the same ones chtc/bo/bo_all.dag uses, and `last4_marginal` takes
# the 20-level studies on purpose: it is a slice of their predictive, not its own model.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- prepare
JOB prep_202003 prep_month.sub
VARS prep_202003 month="202003"
JOB prep_202007 prep_month.sub
VARS prep_202007 month="202007"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ score
JOB eval_xco2_202003 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_xco2_202003 task="xco2" month="202003" det_study="det_xco2" flow_study="nf_xco2"
PARENT prep_202003 CHILD eval_xco2_202003

JOB eval_profiles_202003 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_profiles_202003 task="profiles" month="202003" det_study="det_profiles" flow_study="nf_profiles"
PARENT prep_202003 CHILD eval_profiles_202003

JOB eval_last4_202003 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_last4_202003 task="last4" month="202003" det_study="det_last4" flow_study="nf_last4"
PARENT prep_202003 CHILD eval_last4_202003

JOB eval_xco2_202007 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_xco2_202007 task="xco2" month="202007" det_study="det_xco2" flow_study="nf_xco2"
PARENT prep_202007 CHILD eval_xco2_202007

JOB eval_profiles_202007 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_profiles_202007 task="profiles" month="202007" det_study="det_profiles" flow_study="nf_profiles"
PARENT prep_202007 CHILD eval_profiles_202007

JOB eval_last4_202007 eval_month.sub
VARS eval_last4_202007 task="last4" month="202007" det_study="det_last4" flow_study="nf_last4"
PARENT prep_202007 CHILD eval_last4_202007

# A failed scoring job should not stop the other month. RETRY is 0 for the same reason
# max_retries is 0 in the submit files: OSDF refuses to overwrite the archive an exiting
# job already uploaded, so an automatic retry replaces a real error with a transfer one.
RETRY ALL_NODES 0
